  "prefLabel": "Rev 1111.04 Form MS-25, School Financial Report",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1111.04 Form MS-25, School Financial Report.\n\n(a) The school board shall complete and file annually not later than September 1 Form MS-25, school financial report with the department of revenue administration.\n\n(b) Form MS-25 shall contain dated signatures of the school board chairperson and the superintendent of schools along with the signatures of school board members to certify that the information contained in the form is true, accurate, and complete.\n\n(c) Form MS-25 shall be completed by using:\n\n(1) Balance sheet accounts listed in Rev 1110;\n\n(2) Revenue source codes listed in Rev 1106; and\n\n(3) Expenditures by function codes listed in Rev 1107.\n\nSource. #6125, eff 11-23-95; ss by #6476, eff 3-26-97; amd and moved by #6869, eff 10-20-98 (formerly Rev 1111.10); ss and moved by #8306, eff 3-22-05 (from Rev 1111.03); ss by #10304, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13503, eff 12-9-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1100.html"
